flowchart TD
  A([Start: send FILE --to HOST]) --> B[Read file, compute SHA-256,<br/>split into 1024-byte segments]
  B --> C[Send SYN with file info]
  C --> D{SYN-ACK received<br/>before RTO?}
  D -- no --> E{retries left?}
  E -- yes --> C
  E -- no --> X([Fail: no connection])
  D -- yes --> F[Send ACK, ESTABLISHED]
  F --> G[Send new segments while<br/>in flight < min N, cwnd, rwnd]
  G --> H[select: wait for ACK<br/>or next timer deadline]
  H --> I{Event?}
  I -- new ACK --> J[Slide window, RTT sample<br/>Karn's rule, cwnd grows,<br/>reset RTO back-off]
  I -- 3 duplicate ACKs --> K[Fast retransmit<br/>GBN: go back N<br/>SR: resend lowest hole<br/>cwnd reduced]
  I -- timer expired --> L[Retransmit<br/>GBN: whole window<br/>SR: that packet only<br/>RTO doubles, cwnd = 1]
  J --> M{All segments ACKed?}
  K --> M
  L --> M
  M -- no --> G
  M -- yes --> N[Send FIN with SHA-256]
  N --> O{FIN-ACK says ok?}
  O -- yes --> P([Success: file delivered and verified])
  O -- corrupt --> Q([Fail: hash mismatch])
